---
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout title="Cookie Protocol">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 prose prose-sm prose-gray">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 uppercase mb-8">Cookie Protocol.</h1>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Last Updated: April 8, 2026</p>
    <p>To ensure operational efficiency and secure your session state, Symeno LLC utilizes browser cookies.</p>
    <h3>1. Essential Operations</h3>
    <p>We use encrypted tokens to maintain your authentication status (JWT) and CSRF tokens to prevent cross-site request forgery. These are non-negotiable for system security.</p>
    <h3>2. Analytics Telemetry</h3>
    <p>We log aggregate traffic patterns to optimize server loads and adjust our arbitrage algorithms. You may opt out via browser DNT settings.</p>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>
